# LangGraph Standards

- All graph nodes must accept `ResearchState` and return a `dict` updating specified state keys.
- Nodes must be pure async functions (`async def node_name(state: ResearchState) -> dict`).
- Branching logic must live in dedicated conditional edge functions in `app/graph/routing.py`.
- Emit granular event models (`AgentEvent`) during node transitions to support SSE progress streaming.
